    Show quest "Good. All samples have been collected. This ends all experiments. Good work, <selfname>. Clap, clap, clap!\n\nNow, I need to find out how all my precious samples work. The best coagulant would be the [Muddy Coagulant] made from [Half-Troll Warrior] . Why are you still there? You heard me! Now, go!"

